    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d234">

                <pb facs="0264" n="148" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg148"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 893.51/1014.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the American
                    Minister</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-07-25">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 25, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>As long as the other Governments concerned do likewise, the Department must
                    adhere to the position stated in the instruction to you dated July 2. In other
                    respects the company must use its own discretion.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Knox.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
